# VCS
.git
.gitignore

# Dependencies — installed fresh inside the image, never copied from the host
**/node_modules

# Build output — rebuilt inside the image
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets — never bake into an image
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem

# Test & coverage artifacts
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Misc / heavy
archive
TASKS.md
docs/screenshots
.DS_Store
*.log
